and I'm going to get you
out of here alive.

734
01:24:50.319 --> 01:24:52.219
And then we'll testify?

735
01:24:52.221 --> 01:24:54.655
You think they're gonna believe you...
Khalid's daughter?

736
01:24:54.657 --> 01:24:57.558
