when you can see some sense!

748
01:25:41.336 --> 01:25:43.604
It was getting infected.

749
01:25:45.140 --> 01:25:47.241
You could have died.

750
01:26:07.762 --> 01:26:09.496
We can't let them
get away with this.

751
01:26:09.498 --> 01:26:11.498
